Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:09.74,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Hey! Is Miyama Kirishima gonna show or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.31,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:15.49,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, he's not headed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:22.54,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I told Shiota Nao to bring Kirishima and \NSomei Yoshino to a warehouse I'm renting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:26.50,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Which is also where I sent \Nthe thugs you guys brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.93,0:00:30.25,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Though I have my doubts about \Nhow much use they'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:33.00,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, you little shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:37.48,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Considering you spent a month in the \Nhospital with broken teeth and bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.48,0:00:40.25,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,you're nowhere near as \Nintimidating as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:41.60,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,You little—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:44.34,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Hey. Pipe down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:47.14,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, you can \Nhead back to Tokyo right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:50.96,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:55.48,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I've got the hotel Miyama is \Nstaying at under surveillance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:58.21,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,There's been no movement there \Nsince Shiota Nao went inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.21,0:01:02.42,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I told her to bring him \Nto the warehouse by 10PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:05.91,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,If there's no movement by 9PM, then \Nwe'll have someone crash his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.77,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,But when you do grab him, don't kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:15.20,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Save that kind of thing for \Nwhen I'm not around. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:19.14,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,This entire harassment campaign is only \Nbecause you guys won't shut up about
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:21.62,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,settling this score with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:26.53,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,And since I'm footing the \Nbill, we do things {\i1}my{\i0} way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:34.88,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Azami just got to Osaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.15,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Drop by later and give your regards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.79,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:26.83,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That explains it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:31.44,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\3c&HAD41C9&\blur2\c&HFFF7F7&\move(325,36,325,63)}To Be Honest, I Want to Marry You {\c&HFFFFC5&\3c&HD2D480&}Part One
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:31.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure why they wanted \Nanything with me before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:35.45,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,But I recognize the curly-haired punk \Nthat I knocked out in the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:42.32,flashback,Naoya,0,0,0,,Die, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.57,0:03:49.83,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,They're the gang members that \NAkaza Shiori hired, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:53.46,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,They must hate us pretty bad \Nto travel all this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:56.97,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,What are you doing there, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:58.12,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:03:59.95,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.21,0:04:04.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's pretty simple: after I traded \Ncontact info with Shiota Nao,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:08.09,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I set my sights on an apartment building \Nin Kobe that Ozu Kento is staying at.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.57,0:04:09.91,flashback,Shoma,0,0,0,,Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:11.59,flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Kobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.97,0:04:17.81,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You knew he had a place in Kobe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How did you learn about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:22.49,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That comes later. So, what's your move?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:26.00,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You wanna head to the spot \NOzu Kento specified?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:30.02,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It's probably crawling with goons \Nwho are ready to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:37.25,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ozu's a spoiled little rich boy, \Nso he probably paid for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:42.26,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If we take him down first, \Nthe rest are just a bunch of rabble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:45.72,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And if you come to where I am, \Nthere's only four guys to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:48.13,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That sounds doable for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:51.64,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fs15\b1\frz327.9\pos(411,149)\c&H0F252A&}We're leaving. \NGet dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.48,0:04:51.64,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,There's Ozu Kento, the gang \Nmembers from before, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:55.40,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,A guy with red hair and a perm. \NLooks kinda like a host.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.98,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Say that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:04.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,A guy with red hair and a \Nperm who looks like a host?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:08.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino, I can take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:12.52,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Out of those four, only Ozu Kento \Ndoesn't know what you look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:15.66,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Would you please go home right now,\N before they recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:19.84,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Ozu wouldn't recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.84,0:05:23.91,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've been making sure that pics \Nof you don't start circulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.91,0:05:26.86,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dude, are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:33.22,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Still, good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:34.94,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,It is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.19,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Kirishima...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.77,0:05:41.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're gonna do exactly what I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.45,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&H434240&\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(200,1)}Somei Yoshino\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.45,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\an7\fade(200,1)}Found Ozu Kento.\N I'm gonna trail him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.45,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\an9\fade(200,1)}I'm on the way.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.45,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\an9\fade(200,1)}Where are you now?\N
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:00.71,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fs25\pos(280,106.363)\frx10\fry358\c&HFDFDFC&\frz345}Number Withheld
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:06.71,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Hello there. This is Kirishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:11.98,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,How the hell do you have my number?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.17,0:06:18.09,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I never expected I'd end up \Nhaving to use it, I assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.22,italics,Shoma,0,0,0,,Would you get to the point, you little shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:25.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, Yoshino and I have gotten \Nwrapped up in a bit of trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:32.58,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,There's a karaoke club called Albatross \Nin the western district, room 211...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.07,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've got her hiding there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:39.00,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I just sent you the directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.40,0:06:44.25,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've got business to attend to, so would \Nyou mind picking her up right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.73,0:06:48.29,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You know what's gonna happen \Nto you if she's hurt, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:51.37,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You're gonna pray for death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:53.31,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Sounds lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.31,0:06:57.77,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've recently started thinking I'd \Nbe better off with you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.59,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Let's mark that down for later, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:02.50,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Now, get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:13.04,Default,Takeshi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:17.58,Default,Takeshi,0,0,0,,He and the girl apparently just left \Nthe hotel and got into a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:20.75,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Tell your boys to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:22.60,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Do not lose sight of that cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:24.59,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.97,0:07:28.21,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'm going for a smoke. \NLet me know if anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:37.91,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Got it. So you want me to meet up \Nwith the guys watching Miyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:45.61,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Ugh, what a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.96,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,See ya, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.35,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,It's good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.20,0:08:02.89,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up fast \Nand head back to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:10.88,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'm honestly not sure why you're willing \Nto do all this for these no-name punks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:14.72,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,But getting dragged into \Ntheir stupid revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:17.31,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,especially considering \Nthe cost, I'm not a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:26.39,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I-I mean, I'll make sure it gets done,\N since you're the one asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.04,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:47.47,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh! Ozu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:52.28,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,It {\i1}is{\i0} you! Do you remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:09:00.64,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Uh, so you're Suzuki Mai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.95,0:09:05.08,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yep, that's me. Suzuki, fourth-year at Houyou U.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:06.63,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You don't remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:10.19,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We met at an inter-school social last year...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:12.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but I guess there were \Na lot of people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:17.70,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry. If I'm being honest,\N I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.67,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I left partway through, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:23.33,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,What are you doing in Osaka, \NSuzuki-san? Traveling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:27.16,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Nah. My family lives down \Nhere, so I'm visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.36,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Huh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:32.66,italics,Ozu,0,0,0,,Have I met this girl before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:38.05,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,300)\bord0\fs15\frz18.18\move(315,93,313,76)\c&H444744&\frx8\fry6}Posts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:38.05,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,300)\bord0\fs15\frz18.18\move(394,70,404,51)\c&H606360&\frx10\fry10}Following
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:38.05,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,300)\bord0\fs15\frz18.18\move(267,146,256,142)}Suzuki Mai
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:38.05,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,300)\bord0\fs15\frz18.18\move(239,187,224,188)}4th Year
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:38.05,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,300)\fs15\frz18.18\3c&HEF9C2E&\c&HFFF8D9&\move(374,197,376,201)}Follow
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:38.05,sign_generic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fade(200,300)\bord0\fs15\b1\c&H2F302F&\move(362,272,356,285)\frz17.34\frx0\fry6}This account is not public.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.11,0:09:37.11,italics,Ozu,0,0,0,,I found an account that \Nseems to match her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.39,italics,Ozu,0,0,0,,Could Miyama Kirishima have sent her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:42.93,italics,Ozu,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:47.68,italics,Ozu,0,0,0,,If he knew where I was, he \Nwould've shown up in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:52.03,italics,Ozu,0,0,0,,Her face isn't my style, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:10:00.61,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I'll have a gin and tonic and... \Nhow about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.55,0:10:03.91,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, do you not drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:07.21,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not exactly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.51,0:10:10.58,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Just a few drinks. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:15.53,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,In that case... just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:22.97,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fs25\blur2\c&HA6D6CE&\3c&H5833AF&}Karaoke {\blur1\c&H6B48B9&\3c&HC2D8D3&}Albatross
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:34.48,Default,Shiota,0,0,0,,I hate this. What is even going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.10,0:10:38.11,flashback,Shiota,0,0,0,,Hey! Let go! Where are we going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.25,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,We would've been in danger at the hotel, \Nso we need to go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.25,0:10:44.59,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I think where we're headed should be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:46.42,flashback,Shiota,0,0,0,,"Should be"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.38,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You'll need to be patient and wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:53.62,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Someone will show up, but \NI put a phone in your bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:56.79,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,so if they ask you where I am,\N just hand it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.18,0:11:00.77,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,They'll understand if you tell them \Nit's synced to Yoshino's GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:02.13,flashback,Nao,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.54,flashback,Nao,0,0,0,,I already told you where to find Ozu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:06.64,flashback,Nao,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with me anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:08.30,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:13.43,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I really should have blocked your account \Nthe second I noticed it in Yoshino's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.43,0:11:15.30,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You've done nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:20.68,flashback,Kirishima,0,0,0,,So, please... stop talking for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:23.50,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:27.53,italics,Nao,0,0,0,,I hope I never see him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:35.95,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Who the hell're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.64,0:11:42.72,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You one of his chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:44.49,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,H-His...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.49,0:11:47.46,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Y-You mean Miyama Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:49.22,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,H-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:52.02,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,He said to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:55.23,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,If you're looking for him, \Ntake this and find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.48,0:11:57.47,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,I have nothing to do with all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.04,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You're comin' too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:05.28,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Come on, let go! I really \Ndon't know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.52,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,Who're you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.27,0:12:12.80,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,And where the hell is Miyama Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.61,0:12:19.52,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,I asked you where Miyama \NKirishima is, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.52,0:12:24.28,Default,Gang 2,0,0,0,,Hey, go watch the entrance. \NHe left the chick behind and ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:25.30,Default,Gang 3,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.68,0:12:27.67,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,And call Ozu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:31.15,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,Kirishima is probably gonna \Nmeet up with Somei Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.82,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,Once she's found, take care of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.09,0:12:36.77,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch thinks \Nhe can screw around—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:44.40,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Who the fuck do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:49.85,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Keep her name outta your \Nfilthy mouth, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:52.30,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,You wanna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:56.97,Default,Gang 2,0,0,0,,Asshole—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:08.97,Default,Gang 2,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.99,0:13:25.91,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,Bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:29.16,Default,Gang 1,0,0,0,,You think you're hot shit, you—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:34.68,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Ew, I touched his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.72,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Huh, are you Shiota Nao?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:44.00,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,You're super cute! How about \Nwe grab a bite sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:45.66,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:52.01,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy! I get the silent treatment?\N I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.31,0:13:54.83,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Are you Miyama Kirishima?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:01.39,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,Fuck off, curly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:16.74,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,You think these curls are natural?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.36,0:14:21.51,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,I obviously got it styled this \Nway on purpose, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.61,0:14:25.91,Default,Shoma,0,0,0,,I don't give a shit, \Nyou frizzy-lookin' jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.33,0:14:38.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Shochu my ass! This is basically juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:36.77,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs25\pos(147,40)\3c&HF3F7F1&\c&H5A5E53&}Non-alcoholic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:37.39,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs25\pos(147,40)\3c&HF3F7F1&\c&H5A5E53&}Non-alcoholic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.02,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnComic Sans MS\fs25\pos(147,40)\3c&HF3F7F1&\c&H5A5E53&}Non-alcoholic
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:43.75,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Excuse me, mister, can I get another \Ntwo buckwheat shochu on the rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.75,0:14:46.27,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're still good to drink, right, Ozu-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:50.10,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Uh... I might be hitting my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:55.29,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What? It was {\i1}your{\i0} idea to drink! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:15:00.54,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Oh, I was wanting to try the red.\N Let me order that too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.91,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Drink this, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:07.79,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Sorry, let me just run to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:16.12,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.18,italics,Naoya,0,0,0,,Hey! Where the fuck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:20.94,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,Don't scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:23.40,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Miyama contacted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:26.94,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,He ditched the broad and \Nleft the karaoke place!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:32.45,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,He even sent us a map!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:38.95,Default,Naoya,0,0,0,,Hey, have all the guys at the \Nwarehouse join up with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:42.96,Default,Ozu,0,0,0,,I told you not to make moves like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:47.14,italics,Naoya,0,0,0,,Screw you! We're tired of taking \Norders from a pissant like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.14,0:15:48.45,italics,Naoya,0,0,0,,Fuck off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.27,0:15:58.14,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dammit, where the hell did he go?!\N Pay the damn tab!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.23,0:16:02.48,sign_generic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs20\bord0\c&HFFFFFD&\frz45.25\move(229,151,255,166)}Miyama Kirishima\N{\fs15}Cell Phone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:04.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Hello, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:07.34,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Where exactly are you now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:11.00,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Just left the karaoke place. \NI'm still in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.08,0:16:14.98,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I told you to do what I said, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:17.10,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I know, and I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:21.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You were right, the corner room on the \Nsecond floor of that karaoke place...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:26.41,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,There was a window behind the TV which \Nmade it easy to drop onto a back street.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:29.39,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And what I told you to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:34.87,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Was to ditch your tail and then meet \Nup with me with Shiota Nao!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:36.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You did something else, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.85,0:16:41.05,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I had Ozu Kento right where I \Nwanted him, but he just took off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.05,0:16:42.88,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And where's Shiota Nao?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:46.13,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,She was kind of in the way, so I \Nleft her at the karaoke place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:49.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I had Toriashi-san pick her up,\N so it should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:53.66,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You dragged Shoma into this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:56.95,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know anyone \Nelse in Osaka, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:17:01.65,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,He didn't seem happy about it, but he \Nwas the only one who came to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:07.67,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If you keep screwing with him, \Nhe will {\i1}actually{\i0} kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:13.40,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why did you have \Nto mess with everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:16.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,We could've resolved this my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:20.84,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But if I had gone to Ozu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:25.05,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,the guys tailing me would've gotten near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.55,0:17:29.12,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If you had gotten hurt, this \Nwould all be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:32.56,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I've been trying \Nto avoid for the last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:38.57,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Yoshino, I'm begging you, please go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:42.90,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I don't know how you \Nlearned about Ozu Kento,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:46.57,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but the idea of you being out \Nthere alone... I'm so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:52.36,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The hell do you care what I \Nget up to in my hometown?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:54.83,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I was wonderin' why you \Nwere sneakin' around,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:59.31,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and then I found out you and this Ozu dude
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:02.34,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,aren't just creepin' around \Nhere but in Kobe too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.83,0:18:05.35,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How do you know about that, Yoshino?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.35,0:18:09.51,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dumbass. You two seem to have forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:13.01,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,but this ain't Tokyo, it's Osaka, got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.01,0:18:16.98,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Yet you waltz in here and \Nmake a mess of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:22.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And I'm bettin' it ain't the kind of \Nthing you'd quit, even if I told you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.73,0:18:28.71,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Well, if you're dead set on whatever \Nit is, then don't get found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:31.03,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You gotta operate like you're \Nready to kill everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:34.33,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And if you can't manage that, then the \Nleast can do is die where you stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:38.94,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'll foot the bill to \Ndispose of you all after.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:41.72,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Once the bodies are gone, then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:47.22,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,And if you don't like that, then take your \Nass back to Tokyo, and never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:50.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That way, the moment we hang \Nup, I am done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:51.61,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.53,0:18:59.15,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You know, there's something I meant \Nto tell you today at the aquarium...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:02.42,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Where is this comin' from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:06.40,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,My birthday is November 13th.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.80,0:19:09.06,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Wh-What are we talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.06,0:19:13.91,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I really am a Scorpio. And as of \NNovember 13th, I'll be 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:16.04,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Your... birthday...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.30,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've never told anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.84,0:19:23.08,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I've never really thought about \Nwhat kind of food I prefer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:25.55,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,but I like dining with you the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:30.43,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I don't really have any hobbies, but if \Nyou do, I'd like to join you for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.43,0:19:32.56,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Seriously, what are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:36.95,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm saying, once I turn 18, \Nwhy don't we get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.20,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're seriously asking this {\i1}now{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:44.92,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,This just confirmed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:48.33,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.33,0:19:51.70,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And there's no woman who \Ncan marry me but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:56.56,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You are so insane that \Nit's almost impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.56,0:20:00.35,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Who the hell would be like, \N"Yes, I'd love to," at a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.67,0:20:03.69,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, because it'd be \Nimpossible for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:09.45,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I love you more than anyone \Nelse in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:13.27,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,And I'm sure that if you tried to be \Nwith anyone else, it wouldn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:14.60,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.85,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you pickin' a fight with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.85,0:20:20.58,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Never. But I'm willing to bet my life on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:23.89,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Dumbass. You really think I wanna \Ntake that kinda gamble with a dude
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.89,0:20:25.95,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,who might be about to die anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:28.99,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Well, it's 9:46 right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:33.23,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If I can wrap this up before \Ntomorrow, then I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:34.06,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:35.89,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I'm talking about a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:40.03,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,If I die or it takes a second \Nafter midnight, then I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:44.09,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,I won't say a word about wanting \Nto get married ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:47.63,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,But if I do manage to take care of this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:50.43,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,and make Ozu Kento pay before that time...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:52.77,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:56.14,italics,Kirishima,0,0,0,,How about you make me your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.78,0:21:01.88,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Getting married right away is off the \Ntable, but we can do that, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:06.78,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,For stipulations, maybe we can't \Nbreak up before we both graduate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.38,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Like I'd agree to that, dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:12.56,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Huh, you're more timid \Nthan I imagined, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:14.05,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,That ain't what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:18.76,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Why the hell am I gonna make a gamble \Non some beef you got into on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.37,0:21:21.73,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,If this is a bet between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:25.04,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,it oughta be you or me \Nwho's the winner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.28,0:21:28.60,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You manage to take care of \Nall this before tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:33.05,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,and then beat me on top of it, then \NI'll date you or whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:36.76,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,You know just what to say, Yoshino. \NNow I'm really motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:40.48,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,So, how exactly do I beat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.48,0:21:42.82,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Feel free to set the terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.01,0:21:47.92,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Y'know, stupid, all this depends on \Nyou survivin' in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:51.34,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You're on your own, right? \NYou sure you've got a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:56.09,Default,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Want me to find a spot to \Nhelp you fight one-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.88,italics,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Not that I'm sure there's \Nany place like that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.64,0:22:04.36,Default,Kirishima,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've already found it.
